0..75 Comment "// A definition whose selected arm is another definition\'s call, stuck at a"
76..151 Comment "// variable: `viaZero(Zero, h)` selects `emp(h)`, which cases on `h` and so"
152..227 Comment "// runs no further. The call converts with the call its arm reached, at any"
228..301 Comment "// depth of such arms, and the kernel replays each step (#2832). A family"
302..378 Comment "// computed by recursion on its index is unfolded only as far as the index\'s"
379..451 Comment "// constructors take it (Dybjer, _Inductive families_, Formal Aspects of"
452..498 Comment "// Computing 6, 1994, doi:10.1007/BF01211308)."
500..536 Comment "// The naturals that select the arm."
